# Scheduling portfolio-analyst-ai with cron (Linux, and macOS if the machine
# stays awake).
#
# Install:  crontab -e     then paste the line below.
# Check:    crontab -l
# Logs:     tail -f <repo path>/data/logs/cron.log
#
# This agent has exactly one recurring job - the morning digest
# (config/agent.yaml: schedule.digest, workflows/16-digest.md). There is no
# "main loop" to poll: asking a question is always on demand
# (workflows/10-ask.md). The line below is real output from, on this
# machine:
#
#     python3 tools/schedule.py --all
#
# Re-run that yourself before you paste - it fills in the absolute paths for
# YOUR machine, which will not match the ones below.

# Morning digest, 07:00 daily (config/agent.yaml: schedule.digest.cadence).
0 7 * * * cd /path/to/portfolio-analyst-ai && /path/to/portfolio-analyst-ai/.venv/bin/python tools/run.py --once --digest >> /path/to/portfolio-analyst-ai/data/logs/cron.log 2>&1

# Start in shadow mode. Only turn this on after you have watched a few real
# digest runs by hand (mode: live) and are happy with what gets exported -
# see workflows/90-go-live.md.
